{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>天文台於今日下午4時20分發出特別天氣提示，指出受天文大潮及東北季候風的共同影響，預料本港明日（11月25日）晚上沿岸水位將較正常稍高。部分低窪地區可能出現輕微水浸，居民需提高警覺。\n</p>\n<p>天文台建議居住在低窪地區的市民提前做好防洪措施，包括檢查排水系統是否暢通，並將貴重物品移至高處。此外，駕駛人士應留意道路狀況，避免駛入可能受水浸影響的路段。</p>\n<p>市民可密切留意天文台的最新天氣資訊，並遵從相關指引，以確保自身安全。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b0%b4%e6%b5%b8%e9%a0%90%e8%ad%a6/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">水浸預警</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 24 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T09:04:02.768813+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":243,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T08:45:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T10:17:23.016487+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:57:22.645452+00:00","content_hash":"8bcd8c3f474157a93f13e7abc67557c81931ab903b9b228bb70dfc25e469f657","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}